# --- VCS / IDE ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
**/thumbs.db
**/._*

# --- Runtime caches ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
.turbo
**/.turbo
.cache
**/.cache
.next
**/.next

# --- Build outputs (rebuilt inside the container) ---
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
dev-dist
**/dev-dist
dist-ssr
**/dist-ssr

# --- Logs / temp / test artefacts ---
*.log
**/*.log
logs
**/logs
tmp
**/tmp
coverage
**/coverage
.nyc_output
**/.nyc_output
tests
**/tests
__tests__
**/__tests__
.playwright-mcp
**/.playwright-mcp

# --- SQLite dev DB (regenerated by `prisma migrate deploy` in container) ---
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
prisma/prisma/

# --- Local state (uploads, sessions, AI vectors, user data) ---
.blinko
**/.blinko

# --- Docs / metadata that don't belong in the image ---
*.md
*.mdx
*.txt
LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# --- Misc ---
**/target
**/public/sw*
**/public/plugins/*
**/public/workbox*.*
public/robots.txt
public/sitemap*
public/assets

# Keep these build inputs even though the parent dirs are ignored above:
!**/dist-js/*
!prisma/schema.prisma
!prisma/migrations/
